WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.975
A microgram is a thousandth of a milligram. The power drops by three.

2
00:00:05.676 --> 00:00:10.201
Two hundred fifty micrograms is two point five times ten squared.

3
00:00:10.981 --> 00:00:14.731
One microgram is ten to the minus three milligrams.

4
00:00:20.514 --> 00:00:25.414
Two point five times ten to the minus one is point two five milligrams.
